---
import coverCuento from './img/cover-cuento.webp?url';
---

<section class="relative">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:gap-16">
    <div class="reveal relative flex flex-col items-center gap-10">
      <!-- "Sealed" badge, mit der Möwe darüber -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col items-start">
        <img
          src="/assets/inicio/gaviota.webp"
          alt=""
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none -mb-10 -ml-4 w-52 max-w-none drop-shadow-2xl sm:-ml-8 sm:w-64"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-arena/40 bg-azul/95 px-5 py-2 font-display text-base uppercase tracking-widest text-arena/90 shadow-lg shadow-azul-deep/40 backdrop-blur-sm sm:text-lg">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2l3 7 7 .5-5.5 4.5L18 21l-6-4-6 4 1.5-7L2 9.5 9 9z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          Avalado por la ciencia
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="book">
        <div class="book__pages" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <img
          src={coverCuento}
          alt="Portada del cuento Si los peces hablaran"
          class="book__cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="book__spine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="book__gloss" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 relative">
      <!-- Card with a "schoolbook" feel -->
      <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] bg-caparol p-8 text-azul shadow-2xl sm:p-12">
        <p class="font-hand text-3xl leading-none text-azul/60 sm:text-4xl">
          dato curioso…
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-6xl">
          ¿Sabías que<span class="text-arena-deep">…?</span>
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed sm:text-xl">
          Nuestro cuento es más que peculiar. Nace por la repercusión de
          su propio musical — uno de nuestros baluartes. Cuenta con
          información privilegiada, pues está supervisado por
          investigadoras marinas de la <strong class="text-azul">Facultad de Ciencias del Mar de la ULPGC</strong>:
          la Catedrática de Zoología Dña.&nbsp;May Gómez y la
          Dra.&nbsp;Dña.&nbsp;Gercende Courtois, investigadora en Ciencias
          Marinas y Acuicultura.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* 3D book mockup — perspective tilt, spine highlight, visible page edges. */
  .book {
    position: relative;
    width: 16rem;
    max-width: 100%;
    transform: perspective(2200px) rotateY(-14deg) rotateX(2deg);
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 18px 22px rgba(6, 15, 44, 0.45))
      drop-shadow(0 6px 10px rgba(6, 15, 44, 0.35));
    transition: transform 600ms ease-out;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .book { width: 20rem; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .book { width: 22rem; }
  }

  .book:hover {
    transform: perspective(2200px) rotateY(-6deg) rotateX(1deg);
  }

  /* The actual cover image */
  .book__cover {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 2px 8px 8px 2px;
    box-shadow:
      inset 8px 0 16px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55),
      inset 2px 0 0 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Spine — thin dark gradient that hugs the left edge of the cover */
  .book__spine {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: 18px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 0%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 40%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)  70%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)    100%
      );
    border-radius: 2px 0 0 2px;
    z-index: 3;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Page edges — peek out on the right side, gives depth */
  .book__pages {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5%;
    bottom: 1.5%;
    right: -10px;
    width: 14px;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        #f5efde 0,
        #f5efde 1px,
        #d8cfb7 1px,
        #d8cfb7 2px
      );
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    box-shadow:
      1px 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),
      inset -2px 0 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    transform: skewY(-1deg);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Subtle gloss highlight across the cover */
  .book__gloss {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 2px 8px 8px 2px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        115deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18) 0%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 35%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 65%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 100%
      );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 4;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .book { transition: none; }
    .book:hover { transform: perspective(2200px) rotateY(-14deg) rotateX(2deg); }
  }
</style>
